QwenStride
Derivative source distribution based on HyperQwen and vLLM.

HyperQwen: https://github.com/syv-ai/HyperQwen
Copyright and attribution of upstream authors are retained in source and Git history.
vLLM: https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm
Copyright contributors to the vLLM project.
KVarN: https://github.com/huawei-csl/KVarN
Copyright of the original KVarN authors is retained in kvarn/ source files.

QwenStride modifications include aligned INT8 KV storage, hybrid CPU cache
allocation/restoration, bounded prefill ports, fixed decode CUDA Graph coverage,
and the source-distribution/profile/install tooling documented in UPSTREAM.md.
The original Apache License 2.0 is included as LICENSE; dependency notices are
described in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. Model weights are not distributed here.
